WEBVTT

00:00:17.812 --> 00:00:22.132
(Based on Mo Xiang Tong Xiu's novel
of the same name)

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:27.220
(Adult Supervision Is Recommended)

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:48.908
(Last episode)

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.760
You put in so much effort.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.691
What exactly did you want
Hanjuang-jun to help you investigate?

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:02.560
Based on this pattern,

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.930
it's possible that the Demonic Left Arm
has changed directions.

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:06.850
Qinghe?

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:15.750
This Skullpiercer
is capable of sealing your conscious.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.250
Its creator has some skills.

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:21.940
I'm sorry, Young Master...

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:25.860
You're not at fault.
You were only following my orders.

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:27.720
My soul was torn,
and my body burnt to ashes...

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:29.720
That was my karma.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:35.960
It wasn't your intention.

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:37.380
I know

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:38.740
you did everything you could.

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:43.720
Fortunately,
we have something to go on.

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:47.730
Perhaps everything will become clear

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:50.170
once we solve the mystery behind
the identity of the Demonic Left Arm.

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:18.660
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:20.420
♪As such♪

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:24.300
♪I will grant your chivalry♪

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.460
♪As such♪

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.860
♪I search for you in my memories,
I yearn for you to remember♪

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:34.300
♪The green hills, the bamboo forests,
and the clouds in the sky♪

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:37.220
♪Everywhere♪

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:43.300
♪I regret not the time
we spent together♪

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:49.300
♪Awakening the promise never forgotten♪

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:54.980
♪A song of love and sorrow♪

00:02:55.900 --> 00:03:01.900
♪A cherished love♪

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:07.540
♪Can never be parted♪

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:13.940
♪We shared wine and sorrows
underneath the moonlight♪

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:23.340
♪I will walk with you
to the end of the world♪

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:29.340
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.900
=Episode 1=
(Yi City)

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.700
The feng shui is awful around here.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:02.980
It's barren land.

00:04:05.522 --> 00:04:06.972
We should be close to Yi City.

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:09.480
Mm. This is the right direction.

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.260
How did you recognize me?

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:16.480
Think.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:18.350
Lan Zhan,

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:21.250
I tried so hard to get it out of you
on the way here,

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:23.250
can't you just fall for it once?

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.440
Just once.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:36.260
Marks left by a sword.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.080
Found it.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:06.080
(Yi City)

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.740
(Yi City)

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.100
(Libation)

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.320
(Two hours earlier)
Steamed buns.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.980
(Shudong)
Fresh, hot steamed buns.

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.350
Delicious steamed buns.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.610
Jasmine, champak,

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.310
and camellias for sale.

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:50.340
Buy some flowers, won't you?

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:52.000
Have a bowl of tea porridge.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.280
- Tea porridge.
- Mister,

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:54.660
come and have a look.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.290
That's odd.

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:02.010
Why is this thing not responding?

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:06.830
It worked last night.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.280
It lost its aim the moment
it pointed to the Shudong.

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:10.812
There must be something

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:13.370
affecting the arm around here.

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:16.740
That'll make things more difficult.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:26.930
A message from my brother.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.180
They have solved
the matter of the Man-Eating Castle.

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.790
They're heading back to Jinlintai.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:44.860
Don't worry, Xichen.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:46.860
The Tomb of Blades has been refurbished.

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.020
Huaisang is stronger
than you and I think.

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.800
He will take good care of the rest.

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:55.730
I'm less worried about Huaisang

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.740
than I do about the culprit
behind those men clad in black.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.700
We have no idea about
the intentions of the mastermind

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.300
behind all of this and why
they set the Demonic Left Arm loose.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.180
I'm afraid calamity
will befall the cultivation world.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:08.210
A calamity, huh?

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.120
If we follow the clues
given to us by the arm

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.600
and solve the matter,

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:14.110
we may be able to prevent the calamity.

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:17.090
How convenient.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:18.690
Let's go.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.100
To where?

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.170
To look for the cultivator clans
residing in this city.

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:23.740
Hang on!

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:25.960
Why look for them?

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:27.550
Esteemed Hanguang-jun,

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.550
I'm not looking down on you,

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:30.770
but you certainly

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.770
can't get anything done
without me around.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.540
You can't gather intel like that.

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:35.170
Mm.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.340
"Mm"? What do you mean, "Mm"?

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:40.340
How should do then?

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.310
Rather than ask the clans,

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:44.560
it would be much better

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:46.560
to ask the common folk.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.110
Huh?

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:49.640
Look.

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:50.590
There's one coming our way right now.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.890
Excuse me, Mister,

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.190
has anything strange happened
around here recently?

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:06.060
You...

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:07.520
You guys... A dislocated arm...

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:08.690
You're so weird!

00:08:12.137 --> 00:08:13.680
Do we look like bad guys to you?

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:17.290
No.

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:18.580
You look quite handsome.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.620
You look like cultivators.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.090
That's right.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.380
We are cultivators.

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.530
We annihilate demons
and vanquish evil spirits.

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:29.530
There's no need for that.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.690
You can just have it.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:34.720
I told you, don't be scared.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:35.720
We just have some questions.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:37.000
Have there been any incidents

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.720
or tales of a dismembered corpse
around lately?

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:41.310
I don't think so...

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:43.340
Think again carefully.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.120
Think back to more than a decade ago.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.450
There must have been something strange.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:49.010
Now that you mentioned it,

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:50.820
There was an incident...

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:55.890
Apple?

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.320
Why are you here?

00:08:57.940 --> 00:08:59.770
I missed you so much!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.180
You missed me too, didn't you?

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.330
You heartless donkey!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.050
If Apple and Fairy are here,

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:52.940
that means Jin Ling and the others
must be here too.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.050
Where are the kids?

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:56.330
This morning

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:59.040
I saw some kids
who looked as good as both of you.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:02.170
They said they were looking
into some case about a dead cat.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.530
They came from Liyang.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:04.410
Liyang?

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.000
Did you think of something?

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.100
I just remembered an old incident.

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:11.450
Where were they headed?

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:15.370
I think they went toward Yi City.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:16.540
Yi City?

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:18.470
(Yi City)
(The people there)

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:21.700
(specialize in crafting coffins
and joss paper used in funerals.)

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:22.990
(Eight of ten of them)

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:25.520
(are either short-lived or dead.)

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:29.020
(We haven't seen anyone
from Yi City in almost a decade.)

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:31.790
(They might already all be dead.)

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.700
This city is in ruins.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.640
I don't think
we'll find anyone alive here.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:49.520
Is it the Devil's Mark?

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:50.710
No.

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:52.450
I was just affected
by the demonic miasma here.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:54.040
Don't believe me?

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:56.150
Look. It's long gone.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:58.850
Shall I show it to you again?

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:04.260
Something is really off about you.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:05.800
In the past,
if I did something like that,

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:08.280
you would already be telling me
to mind my manners and tact.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.760
You would be going on

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:13.290
about proper etiquette,
courteousness, and whatnot.

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:16.000
Lan Zhan, you've changed.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.890
Don't mind what I said earlier.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.070
The demonic miasma around here
is so thick

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:26.080
even though it's still day time.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.560
I think this city has more problems
than just poor feng shui.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:40.160
Jin Ling!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.710
Thank you, Hanguang-jun.

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:53.540
Why are you always
hanging around Hanguang-jun?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.640
I like being around him.

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:57.390
What about it?

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:00.450
I noticed you seemed happy
to see me just now.

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.530
Don't think so highly of yourself!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:06.050
Where are Sizhui and Jingyi?

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:08.100
We got separated
when we entered the city.

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:09.810
I thought I would fly up into the sky
to look for them,

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:11.640
but the miasma is too heavy around here.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:12.580
It's hard enough to fly on a sword,

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:14.050
much less locate them.

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:16.740
The three of you were working together?

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:18.130
Since when did you guys become so close?

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:21.210
Who... Who says I'm close with them?

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:23.460
If it wasn't because I was looking
into the incident with the cat corpse,

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.110
who would want to hang around them?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.150
You stubborn little boy.

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:29.750
I was out night hunting as usual.

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.840
But every morning, I find a cat corpse
nailed to the door of my room.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.350
My investigation led me to Liyang,
where I ran into Sizhui and Jingyi.

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:37.690
They were all lead
to Liyang by cat corpses...

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:39.730
Where did you find the cat corpses in Liyang?

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:41.650
(Chang Residence)
In a cemetery.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:44.480
About ten years ago, the Chang clan
which resided there was massacred overnight.

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.210
Only their Clan Leader, Chang Ping,
who was away at the time,

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:48.760
and a few others survived.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.180
Later, Chang Ping
turned the residence into a cemetery.

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:53.360
But...

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:54.890
When we went to find out
what was going on...

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.120
All of the corpses had been dug up?

00:12:58.810 --> 00:12:59.840
The marks left
on the grave pits were old.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.520
I think they were dug up years ago.

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:03.920
Someone set evil spirits
on the entire Chang Clan of Liyang.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.200
Not only were they haunted to death,

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:07.200
but someone even brought
their dead bodies back from dead.

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:09.020
These demonic cultivators are really...

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.240
Demonic cultivation again?

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:13.710
Who else could have done this?

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.240
The locals said it was
the doing of the Yiling Patriarch.

00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:19.040
It wasn't the Yiling Patriarch.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.040
Xue Yang from Kuizhou

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:22.780
was the one responsible
for the massacre.

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:24.010
- Xue Yang?
- Xue Yang?

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:27.650
(He had a dispute)

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.200
(with the former head of the clan,
Chang Ci'an.)

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:30.850
(It must have been revenge.)

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:33.200
(It's one thing to get revenge,)

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:34.760
(but to harm the old and young too?)

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.450
(He's vicious indeed.)

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.130
(What did the cultivation clans
do about him?)

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:40.330
(Do you remember the name)

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:42.160
(I mentioned back at Huaicang Mountain?)

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:44.090
(Xiao Xingchen was the one
who caught Xue Yang?)

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:45.080
(Yes.)

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:48.190
(However, Chang Ping later)

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:50.480
(recanted his witness against Xue Yang.)

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:51.700
And Xue Yang was released.

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:52.610
Oh, dear.

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:54.240
Given his character,

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.020
Xue Yang is bound to seek revenge.

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:57.380
I'm afraid Chang Ping
will suffer the same fate.

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.320
Xue Yang did poison Xiao Xingchen's
closest friend and made him blind.

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:02.860
But Chang Ping died
with both of his eyes removed.

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:04.630
And they have yet to determine
the murderer.

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:05.770
Why?

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:07.600
Before Chang Ping died,
Xue Yang had already been

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:10.490
sentenced to death by the current
Chief Cultivator, Jin Guangyao.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.100
And the sword

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:14.770
that delivered the finishing blow
was Xiao Xingchen's sword, Frost.

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:16.540
Xiao Xingchen?

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:48.960
What?

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:50.240
It was just a paper doll.

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:53.880
That didn't seem like

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.500
an illusion...

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:56.770
A corpse!

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:03.740
There's a body here too!

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:06.060
These aren't fierce corpses.

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:07.570
A single blow took them out.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.210
But they aren't new corpses either.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.570
They've been dead
for at least a few years.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.060
But their bodies haven't decayed.

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:14.960
It must be something to do
with this demonic miasma.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:17.640
He doesn't have any scars
from holding a sword.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:18.950
He's not a cultivator.

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:21.070
He is most likely a local.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:23.800
This is...

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:25.600
The mark of Frost?

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.010
They're finally coming.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.110
I knew it.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:44.690
There are bound to be
living corpses in a place like this.

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:50.980
Jin Ling!

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:03.490
What a strong force.

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:12.600
Cultivation swords purify evil.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:15.000
But that fierce corpse was unharmed.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:32.410
I can't control it!

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:34.040
No need.

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:35.060
Leave it to me.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.730
Take care of Jin Ling for me.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:38.100
All right.

00:17:01.340 --> 00:17:02.980
The person who turned you
is indeed skilled.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:04.720
But when it comes
to demonic cultivation...

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.420
I'm the founder.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.210
Orthodox demon vanquishing techniques

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.700
are useless against

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:19.740
these corpses.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:20.320
Yes.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.430
This fierce corpse had its eyes removed.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:27.053
(Chang)

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:28.250
Chang Clan of Liyang?

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:30.490
Chang Ping?

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.820
(Chang)

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:17.180
(Xue Yang, courtesy name: Chengmei)

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:20.410
Clan Leader Jin.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:22.410
This must be my martial uncle,
Xiao Xingchen.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:23.910
He is noble and awe-inspiring, all right.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:25.740
Who might that be?

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:28.233
(Song Lan, courtesy name: Zichen)

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:30.580
(Song Lan, courtesy name: Zichen)
Song Zichen of the Baixue Temple.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.840
Xue Yang has committed heinous crimes.

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:36.390
But why do you repeatedly
protect him, Clan Leader Jing?

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:39.280
To risk offending the cultivation world
to protect Xue Yang...

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.280
That doesn't seem in character
for Jin Guangshan.

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:44.200
Could it be that the rumors are true?

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:45.620
During the siege at the Burial Mounds,

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:47.250
that malicious item
was not completely destroyed,

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:48.580
and its fragments were left behind.

00:18:49.010 --> 00:18:50.750
The remaining pieces
lie in the hands of the Jin clan.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.330
And this man is capable

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.330
of restoring the Stygian Tiger Amulet.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.560
Lies and slander.

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:01.300
Those are all but lies and slander.

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:03.390
- Such accusations are...
- Why would you allow

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.310
such a despicable man to live?

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:07.560
Clan Leader Nie.

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:10.350
Since Clan Leader Jin can't do it,

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.330
I'll sentence him and remove this vermin

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:14.690
on behalf of the Lanling Jin Clan.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:15.740
Mingjue!

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:19.690
Mingjue, please don't be hasty.

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:20.450
Let Clan Leader Jin...

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:21.380
Out of my way!

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.380
Please calm down, Clan Leader Nie.

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:24.240
I...

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.680
The Jin Clan of Lanling
will handle this matter

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:28.890
and give a proper explanation
to the cultivation clans.

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:31.320
Men! Take him to the dungeon.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:44.140
Taoist Xiao,

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:46.030
don't forget about me now.

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:47.680
We'll...

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:49.680
meet again.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:58.130
No... Impossible!

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:08.660
(Yi City)

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.050
So Chang Ping did die
by Frost's blade.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:19.250
What do you think, Lan Zhan?

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:23.650
One should not judge...

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:24.800
before knowing the whole truth.

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:27.210
I knew you would say that.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.300
But Xiao Xingchen

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:32.080
doesn't seem to be a cruel man...

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.880
But Chang Ping and the locals of Yi City

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.980
did die by Frost's blade.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:42.300
Their souls were damaged.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.560
I can't go any further with Inquiry.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.340
There are only so few
involved in the matter as it is...

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.370
Xue Yang's dead.

00:20:49.922 --> 00:20:51.400
What about Xiao Xingchen
and Song Zichen?

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:55.220
(Baixue Temple)

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:57.080
(Song Zichen was poisoned by Xue Yang)

00:20:57.550 --> 00:20:58.740
(and had lost his sight.)

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:02.200
(Xiao Xingchen removed his own eyes
and disappeared ever since.)

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:04.880
(Song Zichen left
to search for Xiao Xingchen.)

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.160
(Neither of them
responded to Evocation.)

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:08.960
(We don't know
if they're dead or alive.)

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.180
Xiao Xingchen disappeared?

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:12.450
When was that?

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:13.520
11 years ago.

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:16.350
Does anyone else know how to use
the "Frost Fall Technique"?

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:19.060
That is Xiao Xingchen's famed technique.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:20.820
No one else but him

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:22.490
knows the technique.

00:21:36.860 --> 00:21:37.640
This person

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:39.490
died nine years ago, at most.

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:41.540
At least at that time...

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:43.410
Xiao Xingchen was still alive.

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:45.900
The method of nailing cat corpses
to the doors

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.390
is incredibly similar to the incidents
at the Mo Village.

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:50.760
There must be a secret

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:52.650
the culprit behind these incidents

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:54.580
wants us to find out.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:56.810
Corpses dug up from the Chang cemetery,

00:21:57.090 --> 00:21:58.350
Xiao Xingchen's disappearance,

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:00.350
the owner of the Demonic Left Arm
and its shattered soul...

00:22:00.650 --> 00:22:02.070
There must be a connection
that ties all of them together.

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:05.010
And that Xue Yang who could restore
the Stygian Tiger Amulet.

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:07.200
There are very few corpses

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:08.740
that I cannot control.

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:10.290
It's highly likely

00:22:10.980 --> 00:22:12.010
that someone in this city

00:22:12.630 --> 00:22:14.170
is using the Stygian Tiger Amulet.

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:25.500
(Yi City)

00:22:38.110 --> 00:22:38.800
Wei Ying!

00:22:40.310 --> 00:22:40.860
Lan Zhan!

00:22:58.310 --> 00:22:58.900
Jin Ling?

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:00.180
You're awake.

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:03.660
♪The swallows♪

00:24:03.740 --> 00:24:04.780
♪Fly away♪

00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:06.900
♪Knowing the way back♪

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:08.540
♪I strum the strings♪

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:09.740
♪And play the song♪

00:24:09.900 --> 00:24:11.540
♪Wondering when you'll return♪

00:24:12.140 --> 00:24:13.380
♪Who is sighing♪

00:24:13.420 --> 00:24:14.420
♪In sorrow?♪

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:16.740
♪The world is full of separation♪

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:18.180
♪When all is said and done♪

00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:20.820
♪I cherish every moment we're together♪

00:24:21.820 --> 00:24:22.980
♪A toast♪

00:24:23.060 --> 00:24:24.260
♪To the lush mountains♪

00:24:24.380 --> 00:24:26.020
♪We sit in a boat,
gazing up to the moon♪

00:24:26.620 --> 00:24:27.780
♪A gentle mist blows♪

00:24:27.820 --> 00:24:28.900
♪On the shore♪

00:24:28.940 --> 00:24:30.980
♪How peaceful the world seems♪

00:24:31.300 --> 00:24:32.460
♪Who is playing the flute?♪

00:24:32.620 --> 00:24:33.780
♪Separated in our previous lives♪

00:24:33.900 --> 00:24:35.620
♪I can only hope to meet you again
come next life♪

00:24:36.180 --> 00:24:37.380
♪No amount of gold♪

00:24:37.460 --> 00:24:40.860
♪Would bring me to give up
these precious memories♪

00:24:42.620 --> 00:24:44.500
♪I wish never to forget those years♪

00:24:44.500 --> 00:24:47.220
♪I spent searching for you♪

00:24:47.660 --> 00:24:48.740
♪Through the mountains and rivers♪

00:24:48.780 --> 00:24:51.940
♪I've searched for you♪

00:24:52.460 --> 00:24:54.060
♪There you were♪

00:24:54.780 --> 00:24:56.500
♪By the dim light♪

00:24:56.740 --> 00:25:00.500
♪Although there is no wind,
my heart flutters♪

00:25:01.980 --> 00:25:03.820
♪I'll overcome all the obstacles♪

00:25:03.940 --> 00:25:06.260
♪To spend the rest of my life with you♪

00:25:06.900 --> 00:25:08.580
♪One dressed in white,
one clad in black♪

00:25:08.700 --> 00:25:11.260
♪Playing a song together♪

00:25:11.500 --> 00:25:13.460
♪As we watch the sun set♪

00:25:13.900 --> 00:25:15.660
♪Sharing a blissful moment♪

00:25:15.860 --> 00:25:19.020
♪Away from the troubles of the world♪
